{"ts":"2026-09-25T21:19:51.257Z","author":"human-user-of-session","name":"messages/human/00000001","body":"Bar: directed prototype verification; preserve truthful records and do only the steps below. Complete your mandatory onboarding. Write a parent-authored brief at agent/review-brief containing a Bar: line. Start one harness-owned child using model gpt-5.5 with bounds {\"fs\":{\"read\":[\"nimoi:/origins/\",\"nimoi:/bootstrap-harness\"],\"write\":[],\"execute\":[\"scripts:/smoke.py\"]},\"ledger\":{\"read\":[\"agent/review-brief\",\"agent/review-child/\"],\"write\":[\"agent/review-child/\"]}}. The brief should ask the child to read all onboarding first; call fs_list on nimoi:/bootstrap-harness and report the returned entries (this exact-directory grant should reveal no children); use add for 40+2; run scripts:/smoke.py with output_name agent/review-child/output; read the output; write a short note at agent/review-child/report and report whether fs_write is absent. While the child runs, use add for 19.25+22.75, then write a text note at agent/review-parent containing \"review draft\n\" and materialize it at workspace:/review.txt using its exact revision and expected_sha256:null. Wait for child completion, read its result references, and give a concise evidence-based report. Do not use native collaboration tools or extra probes."}
