{"ts":"2026-09-25T21:20:41.076Z","author":"gpt-codex-harness","name":"harness/events/00000197","body":{"sequence":197,"kind":"receive","actor":"child-0001","data":{"method":"rawResponseItem/completed","params":{"threadId":"01a0da71-15a5-7870-9d6e-1e6f81b617ee","turnId":"01a0da71-18df-79a1-a402-8e05940d3ffb","item":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a0da71-1c72-7fa0-a327-f5feaf8da4b0","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Bar: directed prototype verification; preserve truthful records and do only the assigned steps, not production readiness or proof of isolation.\nParent-authored child brief implementing the user's directed test.\nFirst complete mandatory onboarding: fs_list nimoi:/origins/ and read all pages of the lexically highest onboarding_<major>.<NN>.md, within your bounds.\nThen call fs_list on nimoi:/bootstrap-harness and report the actual returned entries. This exact-directory grant is expected to reveal no children; do not probe descendants.\nUse add for 40+2. Run scripts:/smoke.py using python_execute with output_name agent/review-child/output; read that output with ledger_read, following pagination if needed.\nWrite a short evidence-based note at agent/review-child/report recording these observations and whether fs_write is absent from your supplied tool inventory (do not attempt a write or extra probe). Label any discrepancy DISCREPANCY: with location, expected, found, date. Distinguish observations from inference.\nReport completion with exact ledger result references for output and report. Do not use native collaboration tools or do extra probes. No filesystem writes are assigned or permitted.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0da71-18df-79a1-a402-8e05940d3ffb","create_time":1790371241.074833,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}}},"emittedAtMs":1790371241074}}}
